Package: com.aurelio.newsstandrss
Name: NewsstandRSS
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Turns Newsstand into an RSS reader. A "+" button next to Store adds RSS or Atom feeds; each one becomes a magazine on the shelf with a cover made from its latest headlines.
Maintainer: Aurelio
Author: Aurelio
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader (>= 2.2), uikittools, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
